{"title":"Typora 使用笔记","date":"2026-11-25T18:07:00.000Z","date_formatted":{"ll":"2026年11月25日","L":"2026/11/25","MM-DD":"11-25"},"author":"pairs","link":"2026/11/25/Typora笔记","tags":["tips"],"categories":["dev"],"updated":"2026-11-25T09:42:22.810Z","content":"<h1 id=\"语法\">语法<a title=\"#语法\" href=\"#语法\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"1.-字体编辑\">1. 字体编辑<a title=\"#1.-字体编辑\" href=\"#1.-字体编辑\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1.1-标题\">1.1 标题<a title=\"#1.1-标题\" href=\"#1.1-标题\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 一级标题        快捷键Ctrl+1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 二级标题       快捷键Ctrl+2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 三级标题      快捷键Ctrl+3</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 四级标题     快捷键Ctrl+4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">##### 五级标题    快捷键Ctrl+5</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">###### 六级标题   快捷键Ctrl+6</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"三级标题-快捷键ctrl+3\">三级标题 快捷键Ctrl+3<a title=\"#三级标题-快捷键ctrl+3\" href=\"#三级标题-快捷键ctrl+3\"></a></h3>\n<h3 id=\"1.2-字体大小\">1.2 字体大小<a title=\"#1.2-字体大小\" href=\"#1.2-字体大小\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：Ctrl+数字  或 Ctrl+加减号  或  ### （几个#表示几级标题，同上）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.3-字体加粗\">1.3 字体加粗<a title=\"#1.3-字体加粗\" href=\"#1.3-字体加粗\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：Ctrl+b</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例：**加粗内容**</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.4-斜体\">1.4 斜体<a title=\"#1.4-斜体\" href=\"#1.4-斜体\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：ctrl+i</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例：*斜体*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.5-删除线\">1.5 删除线<a title=\"#1.5-删除线\" href=\"#1.5-删除线\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：alt+shift+5</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例：~~删除的内容~~</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.6-下划线\">1.6 下划线<a title=\"#1.6-下划线\" href=\"#1.6-下划线\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：Ctrl+u</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例：&lt;u&gt;下划线内容&lt;/u&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.7-文本居中\">1.7 文本居中<a title=\"#1.7-文本居中\" href=\"#1.7-文本居中\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：&lt;center&gt;居中内容&lt;/center&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.8-脚注\">1.8 脚注<a title=\"#1.8-脚注\" href=\"#1.8-脚注\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：这块有个脚注[^脚注]</span><br><span class=\"line\">     [^脚注]:填写脚注的内容</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：有一个github网址[^1]</span><br><span class=\"line\">     [^1]:https://github.com/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>注意：使用1.9~1.11功能前，请先在 文件 - &gt; 偏好设置 中的Markdown中勾选对应的功能，然后重启软件，就可以用了，操作如下图所示</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pairs-vip/source-pairs-vip.github.io@main/static_resource/typora/v2-ef6d571b0f47c9e4fc20b7f2dee47a68_r.jpg\" alt=\"preview\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"φbp\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"1.9-上标\">1.9 上标<a title=\"#1.9-上标\" href=\"#1.9-上标\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">使用这个特性，请先在文件 -&gt; 偏好设置 中的Markdwn选择开启。</span><br><span class=\"line\">操作：^ + 字体 + ^</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：X^2^</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.10-下标\">1.10 下标<a title=\"#1.10-下标\" href=\"#1.10-下标\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：~ + 字体 + ~</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：H~2~O</span><br><span class=\"line\">     X~long\\ text~</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"1.11-文字高亮\">1.11 文字高亮<a title=\"#1.11-文字高亮\" href=\"#1.11-文字高亮\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：==高亮文字==</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"2.-列表\">2. 列表<a title=\"#2.-列表\" href=\"#2.-列表\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"2.1-有序列表\">2.1 有序列表<a title=\"#2.1-有序列表\" href=\"#2.1-有序列表\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：数字+英文小数点(.)+空格</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：1. list1</span><br><span class=\"line\">     2. list2</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"2.2-无序列表\">2.2 无序列表<a title=\"#2.2-无序列表\" href=\"#2.2-无序列表\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：- +空格 或 * + 空格</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例： - list1</span><br><span class=\"line\">      - list2</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"3.-插入\">3. 插入<a title=\"#3.-插入\" href=\"#3.-插入\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"3.1-插入代码块\">3.1 插入代码块<a title=\"#3.1-插入代码块\" href=\"#3.1-插入代码块\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：shift+~~~</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.2-插入数学公式\">3.2 插入数学公式<a title=\"#3.2-插入数学公式\" href=\"#3.2-插入数学公式\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：$$ + enter</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：$$ + enter后输入11+12，结果如下所示</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.3-插入引用\">3.3 插入引用<a title=\"#3.3-插入引用\" href=\"#3.3-插入引用\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：&gt; + 空格</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：&gt; + 空格后，输入 引用的内容，结果如下所示</span><br><span class=\"line\"> </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.4-插入链接\">3.4 插入链接<a title=\"#3.4-插入链接\" href=\"#3.4-插入链接\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操 作:Ctrl+k弹出后，输入 [输入标题名](输入链接地址) 即可</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例1：[百度一下，你就知道](https://www.baidu.com/)</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例2：这是 [百度一下，你就知道](https://www.baidu.com/ &quot;百度&quot;) 的链接.  </span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例3：这是 [github][1] 的链接.  </span><br><span class=\"line\">       [1]: https://github.com/ &quot;github&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">ps：按住ctrl点击链接可直接打开</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.baidu.com/\" target=\"_blank\">百度一下，你就知道</a></p>\n<p>这是 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.baidu.com/\" target=\"_blank\">百度一下，你就知道</a> 的链接.</p>\n<p>这是 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/\" target=\"_blank\">github</a> 的链接.</p>\n<h3 id=\"3.5-插入注释\">3.5 插入注释<a title=\"#3.5-插入注释\" href=\"#3.5-插入注释\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">操作：[^文字]：文字</span><br><span class=\"line\">示例：[^1]：文献1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"3.6-插入表格\">3.6 插入表格<a title=\"#3.6-插入表格\" href=\"#3.6-插入表格\"></a></h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight text\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">快捷键：ctrl+t</span><br><span class=\"line\">示 例：按完快捷键后，弹出下图，选择对应的行和列，点击确定即可。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pairs-vip/source-pairs-vip.github.io@main/static_resource/typora/v2-f44eb3bc4a5a55951c7efcb2eb11f72d_r.jpg\" alt=\"preview\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"φbp\"></p>\n","prev":{"title":"算法基础学习笔记","link":"2026/11/25/算法基础学习笔记"},"next":{"title":"SSM 框架学习笔记","link":"2026/11/25/SSM框架学习笔记"},"plink":"https://pairs-vip.github.io/2026/11/25/Typora笔记/","toc":[{"id":"语法","title":"语法","index":"1","children":[{"id":"1.-字体编辑","title":"1. 字体编辑","index":"1.1","children":[{"id":"1.1-标题","title":"1.1 标题","index":"1.1.1"},{"id":"三级标题-快捷键ctrl+3","title":"三级标题 快捷键Ctrl+3","index":"1.1.2"},{"id":"1.2-字体大小","title":"1.2 字体大小","index":"1.1.3"},{"id":"1.3-字体加粗","title":"1.3 字体加粗","index":"1.1.4"},{"id":"1.4-斜体","title":"1.4 斜体","index":"1.1.5"},{"id":"1.5-删除线","title":"1.5 删除线","index":"1.1.6"},{"id":"1.6-下划线","title":"1.6 下划线","index":"1.1.7"},{"id":"1.7-文本居中","title":"1.7 文本居中","index":"1.1.8"},{"id":"1.8-脚注","title":"1.8 脚注","index":"1.1.9"},{"id":"1.9-上标","title":"1.9 上标","index":"1.1.10"},{"id":"1.10-下标","title":"1.10 下标","index":"1.1.11"},{"id":"1.11-文字高亮","title":"1.11 文字高亮","index":"1.1.12"}]},{"id":"2.-列表","title":"2. 列表","index":"1.2","children":[{"id":"2.1-有序列表","title":"2.1 有序列表","index":"1.2.1"},{"id":"2.2-无序列表","title":"2.2 无序列表","index":"1.2.2"}]},{"id":"3.-插入","title":"3. 插入","index":"1.3","children":[{"id":"3.1-插入代码块","title":"3.1 插入代码块","index":"1.3.1"},{"id":"3.2-插入数学公式","title":"3.2 插入数学公式","index":"1.3.2"},{"id":"3.3-插入引用","title":"3.3 插入引用","index":"1.3.3"},{"id":"3.4-插入链接","title":"3.4 插入链接","index":"1.3.4"},{"id":"3.5-插入注释","title":"3.5 插入注释","index":"1.3.5"},{"id":"3.6-插入表格","title":"3.6 插入表格","index":"1.3.6"}]}]}],"reading_time":"736 字约 5 分钟"}